      "statement": "CpuManager starts one host worker in single-core mode or one per emulated CPU core in multicore mode. The guest run loop delegates to the current PhysicalCore, then handles interrupts. The single-core loop explicitly advances core timing and performs single-core preemption between execution slices.",
